 "case:locations.hall.description": "The entrance hall at the heart of the house. Every room opens off it: the corridor to the study, the conservatory’s glass door, the boot room and the stairs. The telephone stands on its table, still dead.",
 "case:locations.hall.hotspots.hs_boot_room.label": "Boot room shelf",
 "case:locations.hall.hotspots.hs_boot_room.text": "The boot room smells of wet wool and dubbin. On the high shelf, the gardener’s tins and jars.",
 "case:locations.hall.hotspots.hs_clock.label": "Grandfather clock",
 "case:locations.hall.hotspots.hs_clock.text": "The grandfather clock is exact to the second. Lionel wound and set it himself every Sunday. Today, for the first time in thirty years, nobody will.",
 "case:locations.hall.hotspots.hs_corridor.label": "Study corridor",
